invalid type: string "7.3.6 Zero Liquid Discharge (ZLD)\nZLD is a high -end treatment approach where\nall wastewater is treated and recycled, leaving\nno liquid waste for discharge. It includes\nevaporation, crystallization and advanced\nmembrane technologies like reverse osmosis.\nWhile environmentally sustainable, it is capital\nand energy -intensive and suitable mainly for large\netic\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ